Verdict
  HybridRecall P3-5 passes debug/cassert, clean release and official memcheck
  compilation plus runtime stress.  True executor rescan, repeated parallel
  execution and cancellation recovery preserve results and leave no worker
  threads or ASAN reports.  The official-memcheck gs_initdb startup defect is
  explicitly retained as a tooling boundary; it does not affect the validated
  ASAN gaussdb execution path.
